{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53786","headline":"题法华山天衣寺 · 白居易","name":"题法华山天衣寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"山爲莲宫作画屏，楼台迤逦插青冥。\n云生座底铺金地，风起松梢韵宝铃。\n龙喷水声连击罄，猿啼月色闲持经。\n时人不信非凡境，试入玄关一夜听。\n（同前卷八。\n以上三首参邹志方《唐诗补录》收入）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53786.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53786","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}